  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Local democracy, Karelia</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Lokal demokrati, Karelen</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektets syfte &#xE4;r bl a att st&#xE4;rka det lokala sj&#xE4;lvstyret genom utvecklande av redovisning, budgetprocessen och de finansiella relationerna mellan lokala och regionala niv&#xE5;er. Projektet best&#xE5;r av f&#xF6;rberedande studier, seminarier och studiebes&#xF6;k till Sverige.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objectives of the projects are i.a. to strengthen the local self government by developing accounting, the budget process and the financial relations between the local governments and the regional level. The project comprises preparation work, seminars and study visits to Sweden.</narrative>
  </description>
